{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7671288929840580890","title":"硬件产品经理-生态链","description":"1、负责小米硬件产品（如智能设备、消费电子、IoT设备等）的规划与定义，制定产品路线图和生命周期管理；\n2、深入调研用户需求、技术趋势及行业标准，输出产品需求文档（PRD）及硬件规格说明书；\n3、主导产品功能定义，包括硬件性能、结构设计、材料选型、生产工艺等关键参数；\n4、解决硬件开发中的技术问题，推动设计优化；\n5、配合市场团队制定产品定价、营销策略及推广计划，支持产品上市和销售目标达成；\n6、收集用户反馈和售后数据，持续优化产品体验及迭代规划。","requirement":"1、本科及以上学历，电子工程、机械工程、自动化、工业设计等相关专业优先。\n2、熟悉硬件开发工具（如Altium、SolidWorks、AutoCAD等），能理解原理图及BOM表；\n3、具备较强的学习能力、清晰的逻辑思维，具有良好的分析问题和解决问题能力；\n4、有良好的抗压能力、团队合作和自驱能力，做事积极主动、有责任心，善于总结、乐于分享。","city_info":{"code":"CT_154","name":"武汉","en_name":"Wuhan","i18n_name":"武汉"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786112070621,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178035552473448557","name":"产品类","en_name":"Product","i18n_name":"产品类"},"job_id":"7671288929840433434","city_list":[{"code":"CT_154","name":"武汉","en_name":"Wuhan","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"武汉","py_name":"wuhan","mdm_code":"MDCY00000216","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_leve